        ":question/problem": "Let $S=UV.$ What is the value of ${s}_{13}$, if\n\n$$\nU=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,V=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
