        ":question/problem": "Let $D=AB.$ What is the value of ${d}_{24}$, if\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
