        ":question/problem": "Let $L=MN.$ What is the value of ${l}_{22}$, if\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\n${l}_{22}=$\n{{field-1}}",
